/786628924_18011453132942175_4066283856352568047_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=103&amp;ig_cache_key=Mzk3MTczMzA0Nzk4MTg3OTYxMg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&amp;ccb=7-5&amp;_nc_sid=58cdad&amp;efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuMjAxNS5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&amp;_nc_ohc=-qEW03vRROIQ7kNvwE3RGsp&amp;_nc_oc=AdrXkkxG_5JgWzgLsCeYNa0xUAnrFAp39ZRkhak2BEjb6BMNErgpcPwkTY84uNU57DU&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.cdninstagram.com&amp;_nc_gid=pZjtGZ8rdutWQehhzNxs7g&amp;_nc_ss=70580&amp;oh=00_AQLaRYIIszXbFzOKAHLFozJUUQFvLNiQVwfTUs3P0Erc-A&amp;oe=6AB41CEC\" alt=\"PSA: With agora by night around the corner, it’s time to discover that your trusty deck of cards is basically a...\"></a><a href=\"https://scontent.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/786529055_18011453201942175_2818993502089293872_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ig_cache_key=Mzk3MTczMzA1NTAwMjk2ODQ4Nw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&amp;ccb=7-5&amp;_nc_sid=58cdad&amp;efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuMjAxNS5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&amp;_nc_ohc=gqJqfiCPdugQ7kNvwFFVVbS&amp;_nc_oc=AdoOr0dvzfNjQmxooEUriHlr444ccjpZUgklh_CDJxdwfhQwcklpibLaIFBR7QrL28E&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.cdninstagram.com&amp;_nc_gid=pZjtGZ8rdutWQehhzNxs7g&amp;_nc_ss=70580&amp;oh=00_AQIdTU46BKDf1yf6loMW_EygxfZP9rRmFF7tJ0s9Cltm9w&amp;oe=6AB4292F\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://scontent.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/786529055_18011453201942175_2818993502089293872_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ig_cache_key=Mzk3MTczMzA1NTAwMjk2ODQ4Nw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&amp;ccb=7-5&amp;_nc_sid=58cdad&amp;efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuMjAxNS5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&amp;_nc_ohc=gqJqfiCPdugQ7kNvwFFVVbS&amp;_nc_oc=AdoOr0dvzfNjQmxooEUriHlr444ccjpZUgklh_CDJxdwfhQwcklpibLaIFBR7QrL28E&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.cdninstagram.com&amp;_nc_gid=pZjtGZ8rdutWQehhzNxs7g&amp;_nc_ss=70580&amp;oh=00_AQIdTU46BKDf1yf6loMW_EygxfZP9rRmFF7tJ0s9Cltm9w&amp;oe=6AB4292F\" alt=\"PSA: With agora by night around the corner, it’s time to discover that your trusty deck of cards is basically a...\"></a><p>PSA: With agora by night around the corner, it’s time to discover that your trusty deck of cards is basically a 500-ish year-old art project disguised as entertainment.</p>\n Also! Keep in mind that these cards were never intended as historical portraits. French card makers in the 1500s just took their generic king designs and slapped famous names on them for marketing/entertainment value. They were projecting their own medieval worldview onto ancient history ,Alexander became a “king” in the European feudal sense, even though he was actually a Hellenistic emperor.<p>\nIt’s like if someone in 2000 years said “the King of Clubs represents George Washington” ,future card makers might draw him in 21st-century business attire, not colonial-era clothes. The representation tells you more about who was drawing the card than who it supposedly represents. #Art #HOA #HouseOfArts #cards #history</p>","contentLength":900,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://scontent.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/786529055_18011453201942175_2818993502089293872_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=Mzk3MTczMzA1NTAwMjk2ODQ4Nw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuMjAxNS5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=gqJqfiCPdugQ7kNvwFFVVbS&_nc_oc=AdoOr0dvzfNjQmxooEUriHlr444ccjpZUgklh_CDJxdwfhQwcklpibLaIFBR7QrL28E&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=pZjtGZ8rdutWQehhzNxs7g&_nc_ss=70580&oh=00_AQIdTU46BKDf1yf6loMW_EygxfZP9rRmFF7tJ0s9Cltm9w&oe=6AB4292F","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null}],"tags":["club"]}